{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|2C8BC1844BA6F04898F83182B13270A1", "source_en": "Let the Red Bloom take you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "دع الإزهار الأحمر يختطفك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|328B247E43A5659AB33A138449FF4E6E", "source_en": "The Garden’s vines foretold your arrival. That one of the Church’s hounds yet persists in this stirring city.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "تنبأت أغصان الحديقة بقدومك. ذلك الكلب من كلاب الكنيسة لا يزال صامدًا في هذه المدينة الصاخبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|3925105F449FCF6517E207AAB319B0EC", "source_en": "Your coffin calls, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "تابوتك يناديك، أيها النيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|3BD411524D23077023237F8F8E25455F", "source_en": "Alas your journey ends here aether-spawn.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "واأسفاه، رحلتك تنتهي هنا، يا كائن الأثير.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|56977C20415F69CA9296BA8C7085B68F", "source_en": "I’ll seal that coffin of yours beneath a forest of flesh and bone.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "سأختم تابوتك تحت غابة من اللحم والعظام.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|693FE7134A3D7AA10BEC7F9B7AD5EB30", "source_en": "And now the hound is lost in the Garden.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "وها هو الكلب قد ضاع في الحديقة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|6AA4A97543665C66CFF442ADCC255E11", "source_en": "Stop this, allow me to put you out of your misery.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "كُفَّ عن هذا، واسمح لي أن أُنهي عذابك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|74C69D2348CE64D9393A988154FA2AB0", "source_en": "Hmph. You don't give up easily.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "هه. أنت لا تستسلم بسهولة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|753ED99242957E14D870A48467CDB6DB", "source_en": "And like all stories. come to an end.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "وكما تنتهي كل القصص، هذه أيضاً تقترب من نهايتها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|901CBC4D4EBF38256AA63B9100A22B6C", "source_en": "You vanquish a shell, nothing more.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "لم تهزم سوى قشرة فارغة، لا أكثر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|992DA38A45FC2196A05733A034B93F54", "source_en": "Ahh, from annals of legend itself.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "آه، هذا مستلٌّ من سجلات الأساطير ذاتها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|9BDAFE224800F54FBE3C45A8D68B0EC9", "source_en": "The bloom calls to you, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "الإزهار الأحمر يناديك، يا نيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Felwyl_TW|C5B026AD4DEAA65563B5FA8924E0FC61", "source_en": "The Garden beckons.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Felwyl_TW", "ar": "الحديقةُ تناديك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 2}}
